        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.216,
            0.846,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": "What is common to the lines in the pictures above? They do not seem likely to intersect each other. Such lines are called parallel lines."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.282,
            0.823,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": "**Parallel lines** are a pair of lines that lie on the same plane, and do not meet however far we extend them at both ends."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.344,
            0.723,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": "Name some parallel lines you can spot in your classroom."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.375,
            0.457,
            0.496
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.494,
            0.373,
            0.698,
            0.498
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.522,
            0.673,
            0.541
          ],
          "content": "Parallel lines are often used in artwork and shading."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.548,
            0.148,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.549,
            0.74,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": "？ Which pairs of lines appear to be parallel in Fig. 5.6 below?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.247,
            0.588,
            0.751,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.468,
