                0.805
              ],
              "content": "Fig. 5.6"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.836,
            0.825,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": "**Note to the Teacher:** It is important that the lines lie on the same plane. A line drawn on a table and a line drawn on the board may never meet but that does not make them parallel."
